2:T60b,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you really make video from photos alone?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We produce cinematic motion from stills, timelapses, seasonal transitions, parallax movement, and image-to-image sequences. On a phone screen, well-built motion from photography reads as video and performs like it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What formats do you deliver?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Whatever the platform needs: 9:16 vertical for Reels, TikTok and Stories, 1:1 and 4:5 for feed, 16:9 for YouTube or your website. Each video is exported per placement, not one file stretched across all of them."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you write the captions and hooks?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, every video ships with caption copy and on-screen text written for your property's voice. You can edit anything before it posts; most clients post as delivered."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many videos do we get per month?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It depends on your package and your calendar, months with a big event or seasonal push usually weight heavier toward video. Ask about specific counts during the free trial and we'll scope it to your properties."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who owns the finished videos?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You do. Everything we deliver is yours to use across social, your website, OTA listings, screens on property, anywhere."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"fraunces_d33d7a44-module__zs38na__variable allura_9bd08e98-module__XFiXaq__variable archer-luxury min-h-screen bg-[#050505] text-[#F6F1E7]","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Hotel Video Marketing\",\"description\":\"Hotel video marketing built fr